{"annotations": [], "blocks": [{"bbox": [88.02021278, 29.611933999999906, 466.1882306600026, 35.33202199999994], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 11, "seq": 0, "source": "docling", "text": ", 2026, Vol. 31, Issue 7"}, {"bbox": [48.18889999999996, 57.725999999999885, 293.78720000000004, 365.0975999999999], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 11, "seq": 1, "source": "docling", "text": "Incyte Corporation, Rigel, Servier, Sumitomo,  and Syndax; served on a steering committee for Kura and Sumitomo; served on an independent data monitoring committee for Janssen and Takeda.  E.A.:  Consultancy  for  Ascentage,  BMS,  GSK,  Incyte, Novartis, Pfizer, Takeda. V.D.S.: Honoraria from, advisory board or speakers bureau for AbbVie, AOP-Health, BMS, GSK, Novartis, Sobi.  T.G.:  No  relevant  conflicts  of  interest  to  declare.  M.B.: Honoraria  from  AbbVie,  AOP,  BMS,  GSK,  Incyte  Corporation, Novartis, Otsuka, and Servier. F. Palandri: Consultancy and honoraria from AOP, BMS, GSK, Incyte Corporation, Novartis, Sanofi, Sobi,  and  Takeda.  F.  Pane:  Honoraria  from  Incyte  Corporation and Novartis; speakers bureau for BMS, Novartis, and Pfizer. A. P.:  Honoraria  from  Alexion,  BMS,  Incyte  Corporation,  Novartis, Pfizer, Recordati Sanofi, Sobi, and Takeda. Other financial relationships:  Alexion  Hospitality  at  ASH  2022,  Sobi  Hospitality  at ASH 2023, Sanofi Hospitality at EHA 2022, Sanofi Hospitality at EHA 2021. H.R.: Consultancy and honoraria from: GSK, Hemanext, and Novartis. L.R.: No relevant conflicts of interest to declare. A.Y.: Advisory role for AbbVie, Acceleron Pharma, Apellis,  Blueprint  Medicine,  CTI  Pharma,  Gilead,  GSK,  Incyte Corporation, Karyopharm Therapeutics, Notable Labs, Novartis, Pharmaessentia, Pfizer, Protagonist, and Servier. Research funding  from  Menarini-Stemline  and Sobi. F.Z., M.S., and  A.A.: Employment by and stock ownership in Incyte Corporation. A.M. V.:  Honoraria  from  and/or  advisory  board  for  AOP,  GSK,  Incyte Corporation, Italfarmaco, Menarini Stemline, and Novartis; Research support from Lonctura."}, {"bbox": [48.1889, 386.50693399999994, 161.39388035, 400.147022], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 11, "seq": 2, "source": "docling", "text": "Data availability"}, {"bbox": [48.18889999999996, 408.655, 293.78450000000004, 577.8091], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "paragraph", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 11, "seq": 3, "source": "docling", "text": "Incyte Corporation (Wilmington, DE) is committed to data sharing that advances science and medicine while protecting patient privacy.  Qualified  external  scientific  researchers  may  request anonymized data sets owned by Incyte for the purpose of conducting legitimate scientific research. Researchers may request anonymized  data  sets  from  any  interventional  study  (except phase 1 studies) for which the product and indication have been approved on or after January 1, 2020, in at least one major market (eg, United States, European Union, and Japan). Data will be available for request after the primary publication or 2 years after  the  study  has  ended.  Information  on  Incyte's  clinical  trial data-sharing policy and instructions for submitting clinical trial data  requests  are  available  at:  https://www.incyte.com/Portals/ 0/Assets/Compliance%20and%20Transparency/clinical-trial-datasharing.pdf? ver=2020-05-21-132838-960"}, {"bbox": [48.1889, 600.748934, 124.2323906, 614.389022], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "heading", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 11, "seq": 4, "source": "docling", "text": "References"}, {"bbox": [48.1889, 623.1809999999999, 293.7926, 677.1918], "bold": null, "confidence": 1.0, "font_size": null, "kind": "list_item", "ocr_engine": null, "page": 11, "s